# Akamu ACME — Directory Discovery (RFC 8555 §7.1.1)
Output docs/gifs/11-acme-directory.mp4
Set FontSize 16
Set Width 1200
Set Height 700
Set Theme "Catppuccin Mocha"
Set Padding 20
Set TypingSpeed 30ms
Set Shell "bash"

Type "# ACME Directory — akamu-rsa.cert-lab.local (RFC 8555 §7.1.1)"
Enter
Sleep 1s
Type "./lab acme-directory -p rsa"
Enter
Sleep 5s
